      "body": "[AppCub](https://appcub.io) is a fast and easy-to-use tool for generating **app store screenshots** across platforms like the App Store and Google Play.\n\nNo login required — just upload your screenshots, customize frames, text, background and styles, and export a full set of store-ready images optimized for multiple devices.\n\n#### ✅ Key Features\n\n- ⚡️ **Fast workflow**: Get started instantly, no sign-up needed\n- 🎨 **Fully customizable**: Adjust fonts, colors, backgrounds, corner radius, borders, shadows, and more\n- 📱 **Supports all devices**: iOS, Android, iPad and custom resolutions\n- ☁️ **Cloud-based projects**: Auto-save screenshots with multi-project support, continue editing anytime\n- 📤 **Batch export**: Download all screenshots at once, ready for store submission\n\n#### 💡 Who is it for?\n\n- Developers, indie makers, designers, or marketers preparing app listings  \n- Anyone needing clean, quick, and customizable preview images\n\n🔗 **Try it now**: [https://appcub.io](https://appcub.io)\n\n<img width=\"1914\" height=\"923\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93470a26-adbf-4212-a01f-9ada52e8154f\" />\n\n[AppCub](https://appcub.io) 是一款面向开发者、设计师和产品团队的在线工具，专注于**快速生成 App Store / Google Play 的上架截图**。\n\n无需注册，打开即用，上传截图后可自定义文字、配色、边框、设备框样式等，一键导出多平台、多尺寸的上架图，适配所有主流设备。\n\n#### ✅ 产品亮点\n\n- ⚡️ **极速使用**：无需登录，打开即用，极简流畅\n- 🎨 **丰富自定义**：支持字体、颜色、圆角、背景、边框、阴影等\n- 📱 **多设备支持**：覆盖 iOS、Android、iPad 等主流模板尺寸\n- ☁️ **云端管理**：截图自动保存，支持多项目持续编辑\n- 📤 **一键导出**：批量生成多尺寸图像，满足商店提交要求\n\n#### 💡 适合人群\n\n- 想快速生成上架截图的开发者、设计师、运营\n- 想替代 Figma / PS、节省截图制作流程的团队\n\n🔗 **立即体验**：[https://appcub.io](https://appcub.io)",
